# EAI-CUSTOM: the shipped offline config IS version-controlled (deployment artifact, like compose files).
# Negations MUST come after the ignore patterns above (gitignore: last matching pattern wins),
# otherwise the bare `extensions_config.json` pattern below re-ignores the negated path.
